{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["Pine Tar is a ",["l","树","Tree"]," sap made from a ",["l","树液采集器","Tapper"]," placed on a ",["l","松树","Pine Tree"],". The process takes 5 days, or 2 days with the ",["l","重型树液采集器","Heavy Tapper"],"."]],["p",["Pine Tar can be obtained by tapping ",["l","松树","Pine Tree"],"s grown by the player or growing naturally in Stardew Valley (e.g., in ",["l","煤矿森林","Cindersap Forest"],", the ",["l","铁路","Railroad"],", around the ",["l","木匠的商店","Carpenter's Shop"],"). It can also rarely be obtained after processing ",["l","硬木","Hardwood"]," in a ",["l","碎木机","Wood Chipper"],"."]],["p",["Although Pine Tar is labeled \"Artisan Good\" in-game, it does not benefit from the ",["l","技能","Artisan Profession"],", but instead from the ",["l","技能","Tapper Profession"]," (+25% value)."]]]],["Gifting",2,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Like"]},[["l","玛鲁","Maru"]]],[{"h":1,"v":["Dislike"]},[["l","罗宾","Robin"],", ",["l","德米特里厄斯","Demetrius"],", ",["l","塞巴斯蒂安","Sebastian"],", ",["l","莱纳斯","Linus"],", ",["l","皮埃尔","Pierre"],", ",["l","卡洛琳","Caroline"],", ",["l","阿比盖尔","Abigail"],", ",["l","亚历克斯","Alex"],", ",["l","乔治","George"],", ",["l","艾芙琳","Evelyn"],", ",["l","刘易斯","Lewis"],", ",["l","克林特","Clint"],", ",["l","潘妮","Penny"],", ",["l","潘姆","Pam"],", ",["l","艾米丽","Emily"],", ",["l","海莉","Haley"],", ",["l","贾斯","Jas"],", ",["l","文森特","Vincent"],", ",["l","乔迪","Jodi"],", ",["l","肯特","Kent"],", ",["l","山姆","Sam"],", ",["l","莉亚","Leah"],", ",["l","谢恩","Shane"],", ",["l","玛妮","Marnie"],", ",["l","艾利欧特","Elliott"],", ",["l","格斯","Gus"],", ",["l","矮人","Dwarf"],", ",["l","法师","Wizard"],", ",["l","哈维","Harvey"],", ",["l","桑迪","Sandy"],", ",["l","威利","Willy"],", ",["l","科罗布斯","Krobus"],", ",["l","雷欧","Leo"]]]]]]],["Bundles",2,[["p",["Pine Tar is one of the options for the Crafts Room."]]]],["Recipes",2,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Name"]},{"h":1,"v":["Description"]},{"h":1,"v":["Ingredients"]},{"h":1,"v":["Recipe Source(s)"]},{"h":1,"v":["Sell Price"]}],[[],[["l","织布机","Loom"]],["Turns raw wool into fine cloth."],[["i","(O)388","Wood ×60"],["i","(O)771","Fiber ×30"],["i","(O)726","Pine Tar ×1"]],[["l","耕种","Farming"]," Level 7"],["N/A"]]]]]],["Tailoring",2,[["p",["Pine Tar can be used in the spool of the ",["l","柳巷2号","Sewing Machine"]," to create the ",["i","(H)54","Floppy Beanie"],". It can be used in ",["l","染色","dyeing"],", serving as an orange dye at the dye pots located in ",["l","艾米丽","Emily"],"'s and ",["l","海莉","Haley"],"'s house, ",["l","柳巷2号","2 Willow Lane"],". It can also be used as a brown dye when used in the spool of the ",["l","缝纫机","Sewing Machine"]," with a dyeable clothing item in the feed."]]]],["Quests",2,[["p",["One Pine Tar may be requested by ",["l","木跃鱼","Woodskip"]," in a ",["l","鱼塘","Fish Pond quest"]," to increase the capacity of the pond from 5 to 7."]]]]],"f":[["Source",["*",["l","打造","Crafting"],"\n*",["l","碎木机","Wood Chipper"]," (0.66%)"]],["Season",["All"]],["Equipment",[["i","(BC)105","Tapper"]," ",["i","(BC)264","Heavy Tapper"]]],["Ingredients",[["l","松树","Pine Tree"]]],["Processing Time",["5 or 2 days"]],["Sell Price",["100g"]]]}